flowchart LR
  Partner[Partner referral code] --> Booking[Fictional booking]
  Booking --> Pending[Pending earning]
  Provider[Service provider event] --> Verify[HMAC and timestamp verification]
  Verify --> EventLedger[(Event ledger)]
  EventLedger --> Eligible[Eligible earning]
  Pending --> Eligible
  Eligible --> OTP[Preview OTP authorization]
  OTP --> Claim[Partner claim]
  Claim --> Settlement[Simulated settlement]
  Settlement --> Refund[Refund]
  Refund --> Recovery[Immutable reversal and recovery]
  EventLedger --> Audit[(Audit trail)]
  Eligible --> Audit
  Settlement --> Audit
  Recovery --> Audit
